.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-update-key 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-update\-key \- Keep a Secret Key Up\-To\-Date
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop update\-key\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR] [\fB\-\-signing\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-added\-capabilities\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR] [\fB\-\-merge\-certs\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Keep a Secret Key Up\-To\-Date
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR
Don\*(Aqt ASCII\-armor output
.TP
\fB\-\-signing\-only\fR
Don\*(Aqt make the updated key encryption\-capable if it isn\*(Aqt already
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-added\-capabilities\fR
Don\*(Aqt advertise support for capabilities that aren\*(Aqt already advertised by the key
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR \fI<WITH_KEY_PASSWORD>\fR
Unlock the keys with these passwords
.TP
\fB\-\-merge\-certs\fR \fI<MERGE_CERTS>\fR
Merge updates into the key
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
